      "sentence": "Fixed block memory allocator for C++: per-class operator new/delete from the heap or a static pool.",
      "paragraph": "Give a class its own allocator with DECLARE_ALLOCATOR/IMPLEMENT_ALLOCATOR, or a compile-time static pool with AllocatorPool. Freed blocks are reused, so allocation is fast and the heap doesn't fragment. Needs the C++ standard library (not 8-bit AVR).",
